{"seq":3,"slug":"ragdoll-blending","title":"布偶混合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/ragdoll-blending","wordCount":1811,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"布偶混合\">布偶混合</h1><p>角色中弹倒地，骨骼瞬间从动画切成物理模拟，身体软软地瘫在台阶上、姿态随地形而变——这是布偶（ragdoll）。但如果切换那一帧处理不好，你会看到角色「啪」地从奔跑姿势硬切成瘫倒，像被人按了暂停又换了张照片。布偶技术的全部难点几乎都在两段过渡：从动画<strong>混入</strong>物理、再从物理<strong>混出</strong>回动画。这一篇讲被动布偶、主动布偶（active ragdoll）、以及那两段必须丝滑的混合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>布偶是把角色的骨架用一组刚体（每根主要骨骼一个刚体）加关节约束（关节限制相邻刚体的相对运动，模拟人体关节）搭起来，交给物理引擎模拟。一旦激活，姿态不再来自动画，而是来自重力、碰撞、外力的共同作用——所以角色会真实地瘫倒、滚下楼梯、挂在栏杆上。这是<a href=\"../foundations/procedural-spectrum\">程序化光谱</a>的最右端：适应性最高、可控性最低。</p>\n<p>布偶分两大类，区别在于「物理是否还听动画的话」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[角色: 动画驱动] --&gt; B{触发事件}&#10;  B --&gt;|死亡/击飞| C[被动布偶&lt;br/&gt;纯物理 完全瘫软]&#10;  B --&gt;|受击/绊倒| D[主动布偶&lt;br/&gt;PD 控制器努力维持动画姿态]&#10;  C --&gt; E[混出: 物理姿态&lt;br/&gt;匹配到起身动画]&#10;  D --&gt; F[扰动消退 权重回升]&#10;  E --&gt; G[回到动画驱动]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[角色: 动画驱动] --&gt; B{触发事件}\n  B --&gt;|死亡/击飞| C[被动布偶&lt;br/&gt;纯物理 完全瘫软]\n  B --&gt;|受击/绊倒| D[主动布偶&lt;br/&gt;PD 控制器努力维持动画姿态]\n  C --&gt; E[混出: 物理姿态&lt;br/&gt;匹配到起身动画]\n  D --&gt; F[扰动消退 权重回升]\n  E --&gt; G[回到动画驱动]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>下表对比两类布偶：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>物理 vs 动画</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>控制难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>被动布偶</td>\n<td>纯物理，无视动画</td>\n<td>完全瘫软</td>\n<td>死亡、被击飞、失去意识</td>\n<td>混入混出难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动布偶</td>\n<td>物理 + PD 追动画</td>\n<td>努力维持姿势但会被推动</td>\n<td>受击踉跄、绊倒、推搡、醉态</td>\n<td>调 PD 难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分布偶</td>\n<td>部分骨骼物理</td>\n<td>局部反应</td>\n<td>中弹时手臂被打飞、头被推</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"被动布偶-从动画混入物理\">被动布偶：从动画混入物理</h2><p>被动布偶最简单也最常见（死亡）。激活时把每个刚体的初速度设成它当前骨骼在动画里的速度，然后撒手交给物理。难点不在模拟，在<strong>激活那一帧的连续性</strong>。</p>\n<p>如果激活时刚体速度全设为零，角色会「啪」地僵在原地然后才开始坠落，很假。正确做法是<strong>继承动画速度</strong>：激活瞬间，用上一帧与这一帧的骨骼姿态差估出每根骨骼的线速度与角速度，赋给对应刚体——这样奔跑中倒下的角色会带着奔跑的惯性扑出去，自然得多。被冲击波击飞的，还要在继承速度基础上叠加冲击力的冲量。</p>\n<p>被动布偶的物理由刚体动力学与约束求解器驱动，本 hub 不重复其原理，详见物理 hub 的<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/constraint-solver\">约束求解器</a>与<a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/rigid-body-simulation\">刚体模拟</a>。本 hub 关心的只是「怎么把它接上动画」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主动布偶-pd-控制器让物理听话\">主动布偶：PD 控制器让物理听话</h2><p>被动布偶的问题是「太听物理、不听设计」——它只会瘫，不会「踉跄两步勉强站住」这种半受控反应。主动布偶（active ragdoll）解决这点：身体仍是物理刚体，但每个关节挂一个控制器，<strong>主动施加扭矩去追踪一个目标动画姿态</strong>。于是角色既受物理（会被推、被绊），又在努力维持动画给的姿势（被推后会试图站回来）。</p>\n<p>控制器用的是 PD（比例-微分）控制器。对每个关节，设当前角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>、目标角度（动画给的）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、当前角速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，施加的扭矩为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = k_p\\,(\\theta_d - \\theta) - k_d\\,\\dot{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0813em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>比例项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p(\\theta_d-\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把关节往目标姿态拉（角度差越大、拉力越强），微分项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-k_d\\dot\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0813em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是阻尼（抵抗当前运动、防止过冲振荡）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 像「肌肉力量」：调高则角色「强壮」、能顶住外力维持姿势，调低则「虚弱」、轻轻一推就瘫。临时把某些关节的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到接近 0，那部分身体就「失去力气」软下去，再升回来就是「恢复力气」——这正是「受击时局部瘫软、随即恢复」效果的实现方式（碰撞时削弱、然后恢复）。这个 PD + 阻尼的结构与弹簧骨的阻尼谐振子同源（见<a href=\"../dynamics/secondary-motion\">二级动态与弹簧骨</a>），只不过这里作用在关节扭矩上、目标由动画提供。</p>\n<p>UE 把这套封装成 Physics Driven Animation / Physical Animation，用动态混合权重控制物理对各骨链的影响强度，做受击时的局部物理反应。调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是出了名的难——太硬则像铁人不自然，太软则站不住、抖；这是手感调校的重灾区（见<a href=\"../practice/procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混出-从物理回到动画\">混出：从物理回到动画</h2><p>布偶激活容易，<strong>关掉</strong>难。角色瘫在地上要爬起来，得从「物理给的任意瘫倒姿态」平滑过渡回「起身动画的第一帧」。如果直接硬切到起身动画，角色会「啪」地从瘫姿弹成起身预备姿，前功尽弃。</p>\n<p>标准解法是<strong>姿态匹配混合（blend-out）</strong>，分三步。第一，<strong>选对起身动画</strong>：检测布偶最后停下时是面朝上还是面朝下（看胸口刚体的朝向），选对应的「仰卧起身」或「俯卧起身」动画。第二，<strong>捕捉布偶当前姿态</strong>作为混合起点，把它当成一个静态姿态。第三，在一小段时间（如 0.3 秒）内，用权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 从「布偶捕捉姿态」插值到「起身动画」：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pose</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>ragdoll</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>pose</mtext><mtext>getup</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pose} = \\mathrm{lerp}(\\text{pose}_{\\text{ragdoll}}, \\text{pose}_{\\text{getup}}, \\alpha)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">lerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ragdoll</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pose</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">getup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 从 0 平滑升到 1。混合期间还可把角色根的位置对齐到布偶躯干的位置，避免起身时人「瞬移」。</p>\n<p>主动布偶的混出更平滑——因为它本来就在追动画姿态，扰动消退后只需把各关节的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 权重升回满、或把物理权重淡出，姿态会自己回到动画，无需显式选起身动画。这也是越来越多游戏用主动布偶替代「被动布偶 + 起身动画」这套老方案的原因：过渡天然连续。整套混入混出的择时由动画通知与游戏状态驱动，机制见<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>布偶把骨架变成刚体+关节约束交给物理；处于程序化光谱最右端，难点全在「混入」「混出」两段过渡。</li>\n<li>被动布偶（死亡/击飞）纯物理瘫软；激活那帧必须继承动画速度（+冲击冲量），否则会僵一下再倒，很假。</li>\n<li>主动布偶用 PD 控制器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=k_p(\\theta_d-\\theta)-k_d\\dot\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0813em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 主动追动画姿态：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「肌肉力量」，临时降到 0 即局部瘫软、升回即恢复（受击削弱-恢复效果）；与弹簧骨阻尼谐振子同源。</li>\n<li>被动布偶的刚体/约束物理属物理 hub；本 hub 只管接上动画。</li>\n<li>混出靠姿态匹配混合：检测面朝上/下选起身动画、捕捉布偶姿态为起点、在 0.3 秒内 lerp 到起身动画并对齐根位置；主动布偶混出天然更平滑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../dynamics/secondary-motion\">二级动态与弹簧骨</a>（PD 与阻尼谐振子同源）、<a href=\"../foundations/procedural-spectrum\">程序化光谱</a>（布偶=第五档）、<a href=\"../practice/blending-authored\">与美术动画融合</a>（混入混出的择时机制）、<a href=\"../practice/procedural-tuning\">手感调校</a>（PD 参数怎么调）。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/collision-response/constraint-solver\">物理 — 约束求解器</a>、<a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/rigid-body-simulation\">物理 — 刚体模拟</a>（布偶底层的刚体与关节求解）。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>主动布偶 PD 控制与受击削弱-恢复机制参考开源「Unity.Humanoid.ActiveRagdoll」（github.com/EggyStudio）、UE Physics Driven Animation 文档（dev.epicgames.com）与 Ragdoll physics 综述（grokipedia.com），2026 年访问。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布偶混合","id":"布偶混合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"被动布偶：从动画混入物理","id":"被动布偶-从动画混入物理"},{"level":2,"text":"主动布偶：PD 控制器让物理听话","id":"主动布偶-pd-控制器让物理听话"},{"level":2,"text":"混出：从物理回到动画","id":"混出-从物理回到动画"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"程序化行走","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/dynamics/procedural-locomotion"},"next":{"title":"与美术动画融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-animation/practice/blending-authored"}}